# Brainrots vs. Monsters rules

Read and follow `AGENTS.md` at the repository root for all project-wide engineering
rules. Read the relevant documentation in `docs/` before changing a system.

`AGENTS.md` is the canonical rules file; do not duplicate its contents here.
For documentation audits, describe verified code behavior and label planned work.
See `docs/IMPLEMENTATION_NOTES.md` for current implementation caveats.
